uses world "acme.worlds.dev"
container blocks(out result) target erp_pg """ttrb
Load erp.accounts as t.
If region is "N":
    Keep only the columns account_id, region.
    Show the result as north_accounts.
If status is "open" or region is "N":
    Compute account_id * 2 as twice.
    Show the result as open_accounts.
"""
